OL,3,GNEWSAActor Noel Clarke charged with
OL,4,Asexual offences
OL,5,
OL,6,FActor Noel Clarke has been charged with
OL,7,Fsexual offences including sexual
OL,8,Fassault, voyeurism and exposure.
OL,10,FThe Crown Prosecution Service (CPS)
OL,11,Fauthorised the Metropolitan Police to
OL,12,Fcharge the Doctor Who and Kidulthood
OL,13,Fstar on Wednesday.
OL,15,FClarke, 50, from Kensington, west
OL,16,FLondon, was charged with two counts of
OL,17,Fsexual assault, three charges of
OL,18,Fvoyeurism and one charge of exposure.
OL,19,FThe offences are alleged to have taken
OL,20,Fplace between 2007 and 2016 and relate
OL,21,Fto five women.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
